            "body": "End-to-end CUDA check on 1x NVIDIA H200 NVL (tp 1), default attention backend (fa3). Both runs use the same image (`lmsysorg/sglang:nightly-dev-20261015-a6a8c560`) with the sglang Python source taken from each commit:\n- before: merge-base `91f6ef2322`\n- after: this PR `9b987c96e8`\n\n| docvqa_val, all 5349 docs | anls |\n| --- | --- |\n| Before | 0.5933 |\n| After | 0.5933 |\n\n5347 of the 5349 answers are identical.\n\n```bash\nsglang serve --model-path google/gemma-3-4b-it --tp-size 1 --mem-fraction-static 0.70 --trust-remote-code --enable-multimodal\n\npython3 -m lmms_eval --model openai --model_args model_version=google/gemma-3-4b-it,num_concurrent=16 \\\n  --tasks docvqa_val --batch_size 16 --seed 42\n```\n",
